  "clips": [
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m05-brief-01",
      "speaker": "SAMIRA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "The engineers traced the outages to this fortified relay. Break the road gate, disable its transmitter, and secure the archive. Those records can tell us who ordered the attacks.",
      "voiceId": "7uxeJ73HfJL9gOH2mttA",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Engineer Samira Haddad",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/en/m05-brief-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.96,
      "sha256": "e3f9fc5acd71a73155afa2d9831e07657031072d79eb2680bfc3b843168becb5",
      "captionSha256": "c21515ac3afc88c8c0c7c1e04cc69cf956b90f2b005e3076130296728656d8ab"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m05-brief-01",
      "speaker": "SAMIRA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "مهندسان منشأ قطعی‌ها را در این مرکز ارتباطی مستحکم پیدا کردند. دروازهٔ جاده را بشکنید، فرستنده را از کار بیندازید و بایگانی را امن کنید. این اسناد می‌توانند آمر حمله‌ها را مشخص کنند.",
      "voiceId": "7uxeJ73HfJL9gOH2mttA",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Engineer Samira Haddad",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/fa/m05-brief-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 16.48,
      "sha256": "d945d0b31446cb096a67fb88540ed56780c555da422a26b5577722293c506d72",
      "captionSha256": "a47e0db385eb1c23160853aaeceb2fc695f1272dbe6669b7f757243aff837d03"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m05-brief-02",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Two rifle squads and a heavy APC are yours. Use the armor to open the gate, then bring the rifles through together. Preserve the APC if you can; losing it does not end the assault.",
      "voiceId": "MK1Zvh93428YrgOQ8Obr",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Major Dalia Rahim",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/en/m05-brief-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12.96,
      "sha256": "cede43b59dbec9d5bb9c75c1e23a4a2e7fa025bc9abab229717b931adeefeeb0",
      "captionSha256": "d22d58a6b7691793fbd9b5c750f3cdba270c313658834641be021f250b9bd282"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m05-brief-02",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "دو گروه تفنگدار و یک نفربر سنگین در اختیار شماست. با زره‌پوش دروازه را باز کنید، سپس تفنگدارها را با هم عبور دهید. اگر می‌توانید نفربر را حفظ کنید؛ از دست دادن آن به معنای پایان حمله نیست.",
      "voiceId": "MK1Zvh93428YrgOQ8Obr",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Major Dalia Rahim",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/fa/m05-brief-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 16.88,
      "sha256": "670423c44d0194541e1cba54f62face768fe9c12b509fa82b08d232d1a563ad4",
      "captionSha256": "6957de5c70f3f1a27dcfc5d4926cc990aaab0802519e51e21def1b49d0640b77"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m05-brief-03",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "The relay will erase its archive in twelve minutes. Stop the transmitter, defeat the responding guard, and hold the marked archive area for twenty clear seconds. I will guide each action.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/en/m05-brief-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.36,
      "sha256": "f4fb8a03e9f34bdbaf7feefc03e6f2b6cfd5b416b8336d69480d09bb76bfc2cb",
      "captionSha256": "cb4aaa047be58eeeca538e5352103f429db0b12cdcbd1a753181c32f92fe73ef"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m05-brief-03",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "این مرکز تا دوازده دقیقهٔ دیگر بایگانی را پاک می‌کند. فرستنده را متوقف کنید، نیروی واکنش دشمن را شکست دهید و محدودهٔ مشخص‌شده را بیست ثانیه امن نگه دارید. هر حرکت را راهنمایی می‌کنم.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/fa/m05-brief-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 15.68,
      "sha256": "36fd41164c92f1a79f8095b96721d859cbfa21185761bfb86cd3d0ede0360fe2",
      "captionSha256": "83c920c5a1739a060f5ae783715b087110c72057fd85de1a5ee42b3384a2621d"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m05-comms-01",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "The archive is intact. I have recovered Protocol Fragment One. Its authorization record includes a credential issued to me, then revoked before these attacks.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/en/m05-comms-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.4,
      "sha256": "0c3394d603d0681f6864125a393b9b787b02b0642673a1223919607ad12a12e1",
      "captionSha256": "b74edcd4a74c891ecde1888beac908db2fc360d09d0e32e2f78ee8e65f1fef3f"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m05-comms-01",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "بایگانی سالم است. قطعهٔ اول پروتکل را بازیابی کردم. در سابقهٔ مجوز آن، اعتبارنامه‌ای به نام من ثبت شده که پیش از این حمله‌ها لغو شده بود.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/fa/m05-comms-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.92,
      "sha256": "3fd9e18c849acdb69c5ad600fdf605689b180680ba467103bae358f9d20d6d72",
      "captionSha256": "d48f598740e387c2b6c101649271d3934534ecafa9f68e26ca98c2704ac67e82"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m05-debrief-01",
      "speaker": "SAMIRA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "The relay is silent and the records are safe. We have evidence now, not another rumor. Take care of the wounded; the city needs everyone we can bring home.",
      "voiceId": "7uxeJ73HfJL9gOH2mttA",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Engineer Samira Haddad",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/en/m05-debrief-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.92,
      "sha256": "c02fbc610ee869cd6e247d1fa2a6fa4642c2d2c528e51d3ee6f3733efa88ec2b",
      "captionSha256": "f5f9de18bf91ecd60e040792900dadb2b73b46a199ae24e84213695538fa26dc"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m05-debrief-01",
      "speaker": "SAMIRA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "مرکز ارتباطی خاموش شده و اسناد در امان‌اند. حالا مدرک داریم، نه شایعه‌ای دیگر. به زخمی‌ها رسیدگی کنید؛ شهر به همهٔ کسانی که سالم برمی‌گردانیم نیاز دارد.",
      "voiceId": "7uxeJ73HfJL9gOH2mttA",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Engineer Samira Haddad",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/fa/m05-debrief-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 13.36,
      "sha256": "3d65f43c4cf4085bc49de6a6f5ca6c13baf8e19c86511ee6db1e420117c0b334",
      "captionSha256": "8788809545fc255536a19dc7be0dae82efe89e1b0f2a24178b46d909af084206"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m05-debrief-02",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "The credential was revoked. Someone used its signature anyway. One encrypted message survived: “Qassem. The first node is lost.” I cannot yet identify the sender.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/en/m05-debrief-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.96,
      "sha256": "639365a540f5ef587d992dbdd5097ce8434524c40e7d749bd69f46931e6d94fb",
      "captionSha256": "8015118b14d8f3dfa1aef19adb55765c9fca935c2f9364bc7084fb50abdab735"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m05-debrief-02",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "اعتبارنامه لغو شده بود، اما کسی باز هم از امضای آن استفاده کرده است. یک پیام رمزگذاری‌شده باقی مانده: «قاسم. گرهٔ اول از دست رفت.» هنوز نمی‌توانم فرستنده را شناسایی کنم.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/fa/m05-debrief-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 16.16,
      "sha256": "4faf2993b8df3d7abbe65186becdab52d065a4aa959b02ab7d909dffadc5edce",
      "captionSha256": "d98013997fd110827d518ae567e77cdd35cd3d27db6d73d21b8002e94b46c676"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m05-debrief-03",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "First Response is complete. The reconnaissance team and armor parts are assigned to your roster. Review your results, then return to the campaign map. We will follow the evidence.",
      "voiceId": "MK1Zvh93428YrgOQ8Obr",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Major Dalia Rahim",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/en/m05-debrief-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.6,
      "sha256": "6320dc81cf934340f3ddab826a048c6d4d73f1436a81b288868eb04c4e2f6a70",
      "captionSha256": "06a93d7997abf6ea4b9704173bf8d3c49cc29cfe9f578c33ba2028478d589461"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m05-debrief-03",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "فصل واکنش نخست کامل شد. تیم شناسایی و قطعات زره به تجهیزات شما اضافه شدند. نتیجه را مرور کنید و به نقشهٔ کارزار برگردید. مسیر شواهد را دنبال می‌کنیم.",
      "voiceId": "MK1Zvh93428YrgOQ8Obr",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Major Dalia Rahim",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/fa/m05-debrief-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 14.96,
      "sha256": "084a90aa81cc949325c7475798a36e39a5f8084fb8d62087009541b90652ff8c",
      "captionSha256": "4e0da92bde9eb7b3d40bcdffe7726f433657bd0a0a053759e56d31c4a4884a1d"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m05-01",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Break the gate, destroy the transmitter, then secure the archive for 20 seconds. You have 12 minutes. Keep the APC alive and finish under 9 minutes for bonus stars.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/en/tutorial-m05-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.44,
      "sha256": "ff68bdeda6df4439c23e1c0b0ef99e8e63026332dac95cd56e6d7fc3f40929bc",
      "captionSha256": "0b6c272bc7be9b91ab69409328061ec692adab06ef546ca737a243fd19424954"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m05-01",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "دروازه را بشکنید، فرستنده را نابود کنید و سپس بایگانی را ۲۰ ثانیه امن نگه دارید. ۱۲ دقیقه فرصت دارید. حفظ نفربر و پایان در کمتر از ۹ دقیقه ستارهٔ اضافی دارند.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/fa/tutorial-m05-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 15.36,
      "sha256": "263effce68c2c7b66a5c838bb0191f7b1fce2ced1634c569b53fa552ee6bec23",
      "captionSha256": "59a86025ed251968ff8335d9a2d25e7de1e32e590131ca6fb011b93e4ee83f1f"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m05-02",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Select the heavy APC. If it is lost, use a surviving rifle squad. Show Me marks the unit to select.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/en/tutorial-m05-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 8.08,
      "sha256": "1726c78f770a21d7709b9426c49a2239bc820e7d765cef188f8b5f8f80cac981",
      "captionSha256": "ac4222eedb7b4ec41b9b0cbe04df5d2ee180f74f9ff39c44a164fc6f193ff1e3"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m05-02",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "نفربر سنگین را انتخاب کنید. اگر از دست رفته، از تفنگدارهای باقی‌مانده استفاده کنید. نشانم بده، نیروی مورد نظر را مشخص می‌کند.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/fa/tutorial-m05-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.72,
      "sha256": "f0ff191841ca867629a412c13002e06d7a1dd6fbd2b42cce5704837427d8e521",
      "captionSha256": "62f345c5f675441680824ed33a9edf5dd4d72a0b8b9349716e6d8e27257aee28"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m05-03",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Press Attack, then tap the marked enemy gate. Wait for it to fall. Show Me follows your next required click.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/en/tutorial-m05-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.04,
      "sha256": "675cd5c81339ff8edb85ee723fc594b62f3f32a65ea64c5557ed14aa518ff1f6",
      "captionSha256": "b52aff933109338b137433b5d556a63747f5d4dcbbb1dfe1461c7e073367829a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m05-03",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "حمله را بزنید و سپس دروازهٔ مشخص‌شدهٔ دشمن را انتخاب کنید. صبر کنید تا نابود شود. نشانم بده، کلیک بعدی را مشخص می‌کند.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/fa/tutorial-m05-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.72,
      "sha256": "c3016932644f3d5f4b01646a018947353e8c3085d070efcf342d7ea64a3db80c",
      "captionSha256": "a80f971f9a6f29001bf88dc567a5bf0aa735ef30ceccd438318fafb6187cf212"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m05-04",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Select your rifles, press Move, and tap the marked approach beyond the gate. Keep the team together; enemy reinforcements are responding.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/en/tutorial-m05-04.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.68,
      "sha256": "fcd3e156b83fd39a7c1d465a82aa63b62bee2465d3fa5dc239c5bcbe309a04e2",
      "captionSha256": "0c88692fcc5865c55b0d413b4de8cebfdd724223a05337e5f9aaee45810b2029"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m05-04",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "تفنگدارها را انتخاب کنید، حرکت را بزنید و مقصد مشخص‌شده در آن سوی دروازه را انتخاب کنید. تیم را کنار هم نگه دارید؛ نیروی کمکی دشمن در راه است.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/fa/tutorial-m05-04.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12.72,
      "sha256": "3e4cbaf6b26ccb27ced26e0b48736c4fd38dc87016c29da7252f0707193387d8",
      "captionSha256": "8c067c795dea27c875bc94afe904ff721b57df037608a2adca3da7a932813c6a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m05-05",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Select a friendly unit, press Attack, then tap the marked satellite transmitter. Destroying it opens the archive objective.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/en/tutorial-m05-05.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 8.48,
      "sha256": "b474a6275f402f9d69430ea5339a42293af453c464924155ee3487631c181da2",
      "captionSha256": "af3c1aa01db935d5fa91e5d0229cbb4748dee6a2a863b8ae4b54132335c108a6"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m05-05",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "یک نیروی خودی را انتخاب کنید، حمله را بزنید و فرستندهٔ ماهواره‌ای مشخص‌شده را انتخاب کنید. نابودی آن هدف بایگانی را باز می‌کند.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M05BreachAssault/Voice/fa/tutorial-m05-05.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.64,
      "sha256": "c31931a921f26708df6f01ef2c44f2b26e16ca5d8a841e5d87445938acf42ef8",
      "captionSha256": "d5705566499c6641ee08ed10659775f1b4f3716bf372c087a23b08fda7419bfd"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-m05-06",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Attack the remaining guards. Show Me marks a live enemy. You must defeat the garrison and its reinforcements before securing the archive.",
